comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-11T04:17:35.484Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status2922 census and live accepted-publication search/open/in_progress lists find no existing pending-publication fence. Full pm-wzmbvn history describes completed15-minute propagation budget; full pm-7zs0 is the open release-health observer; pm-release-ledger-origin-delivery is completed source-origin delivery. Reuse pm-u9d0 release lineage and link the actual GH1437 report without reopening those completed implementations."
  "2026-10-11T04:24:15.944Z","harness:codex","The independent original workflow admits accepted-but-missing publication (1failed/24passed). Actual-provider replay against immutable261a2e8f9ca235c42465bf26b8df2cbbc98d2228 now refuses precisely because Release38107714902 already accepted its npm publish step. The guard inspects jobs across all attempts using GitHub filter=all; verified actual job payload carries run_id/run_attempt, so only the currently executing attempt can be excluded while prior accepted attempts remain visible. Extend the same admission immediately before npm publication, retain the reviewed control outside any immutable-source checkout, and unify push/dispatch concurrency on the exact tag. This prevents overlapping exact-tag publishers and tag-push reruns from bypassing the accepted-publication fence. Existing short native fake SHA was corrected to a valid40-character fixture without loosening source validation; its earlier failure remains recorded."
  "2026-10-11T04:25:50.552Z","harness:codex","Complete final linked admission/automation/workflow suite passes58tests; the independent native original publisher actually attempts npm publication against a fake accepted-but-unavailable registry, while the identical corrected workflow refuses before packing or publishing. Independent expression replay proves original push/dispatch groups differ and corrected exact-tag groups match. Authoritative run_id/run_attempt metadata excludes only the current attempt; malformed inventories, missing publication stages, incomplete job identity, unknown status and missing terminal conclusions all refuse. Real immutable11run independently supplied the prior accepted publication verdict; no live publication, retry or tag mutation was sent."
  "2026-10-11T04:30:01.607Z","harness:codex","The unchanged repository-static-quality gate rejected the first admission implementation at CodeFactor complexity32 above the existing16ceiling. Refactored inventory shape, authoritative job-attempt identity and publication-stage completeness into separate private validators; the identical21-file parity scan now has zero violations at16. No threshold, suppression or product semantics changed. The complete58 linked release regressions are repeated after this refactor; full static verification remains required before closeout."
  "2026-10-11T04:37:58.107Z","harness:codex","After the complexity repair, full source, types, docs, static quality, SDK surface and10entrypoint costs pass. The unchanged CLI transport gate reports qualified controls31/43ms but product next/create/claim exceed their existing440/398/415ms best-run bounds (561/443/425ms) while recorded load rises2.58 to7.05. Preserve this as a genuine failed qualified product verdict; release-only scripts do not change CLI source and no margin or policy is changed. Replay the identical CLI gate alone once to distinguish a reproducible product regression from this concurrent observation; green source delivery is not yet claimed."
  "2026-10-11T04:41:31.939Z","harness:codex","The identical isolated CLI transport replay passes all6 operations with unchanged policy; the prior qualified failure is retained and no timing cause is asserted. The next graph gate found six newly mentioned canonical item pairs without typed relationships. Added discovered_from edges for the concrete recurrence and prior implementation lineage through pm update --dep, preserving all existing edges and the1233ceiling. Repeat graph/integrity/mutation and serialized9-package acceptance to finish the unchanged gate sequence."
  "2026-10-11T04:49:37.288Z","harness:codex","Final explicit malformed-data control admitted a completed publication step with an unrecognized conclusion. Reopened/claimed only this owner normally, required a known terminal conclusion, and reran the unchanged58-test linked release suite plus full strict ESLint and21-file CodeFactor parity at16; all pass. Previous close evidence remains immutable and this new close records the refinement. Correct canonical pnpm changelog:pm generation restores repository exclusions and stable item links; the earlier generic generator command was operator misuse, not a pm-changelog defect."
  "2026-10-11T05:12:35.758Z","harness:codex","Final-head a2e739c837db5d245c2fbd9a57179cacab4f3990 has three independent failures retained in CI: Windows fixture Node subprocesses resolve the real gh executable instead of Bash-only fake scripts; static assurance reports two governed defect-evidence findings; aggregate coverage reports a source branch gap despite all four test shards passing. Included full review c1948de9-cf68-4d4f-9705-a248509a693e adds two actionable findings for complete release inventory beyond1000 and its ceiling-pinning test. Reopened/claimed this canonical owner for pagination and portable fixture remediation; inspecting exact coverage before assigning that separate source boundary."
  "2026-10-11T05:16:37.449Z","harness:codex","CI attribution is now exact: the only uncovered source is scripts/release/release-run-selection.mjs, whose current-run environment branches were absent from wrapper coverage; this is not an unrelated SDK defect. Added full unfiltered REST pagination with provider total/unique-id validation and a1002-run accepted-evidence control, preserving fail-closed partial/duplicate/malformed receipts. Native copied gh/gh.exe fixtures now intercept both Bash and Node on every platform. A local fixture edit temporarily removed an older mock executable bit and emitted one test retry marker to GH1017; deleted that exact owned test comment, restored the mock, and rerun isolation before proceeding. No live release or tracker mutation was triggered by that comment."
  "2026-10-11T05:24:19.682Z","harness:codex","All59 release regressions pass and focused real coverage of the changed script is exactly126/126statements,145/145branches,40/40functions,111/111lines. Final types pass. Full static advances through source, repository assurance and policy checks, then correctly rejects the expected_result removed by normal reopen. Restore that required active planning field through pm update and repeat the remaining unchanged gate sequence; retain the failed wrapper receipt. Structured escape_class production_defect and gate_strengthened evidence are now recorded through the CLI."
  "2026-10-11T05:28:43.484Z","harness:codex","Review remediation complete: unfiltered REST pagination validates total count and unique identities, and the1002-run last-page accepted-evidence control passes. Copied native gh/gh.exe fixtures intercept Node and Bash without network access. All59 linked release tests and focused exact100percent source coverage pass; final typecheck passes. Full local static wrapper reached the restored active-planning boundary; the unchanged remaining context/registry/public SDK/10entrypoint/6CLI transport/graph/history/mutation checks complete successfully (context retains an existing warning, exit0). Both full-review findings are acknowledged once and resolved. Structured production escape and gate-strengthened evidence are recorded. The new active-planning recovery enhancement is retained open/unclaimed in the canonical recovery programme; no scope or policy is waived. Final-head hosted full coverage and Windows proof remain required after push."
  "2026-10-11T05:48:04.485Z","harness:codex","Exact 5ed3be663bbcf46e283bced255ad50537414c4f4 full coverage passes68016/68016statements,64689/64689lines,14025/14025functions,52136/52136branches, and all6 packed platform cells pass. The static artifact projection exceeds its20000000-byte first-party ceiling by91bytes; the newly added recovery documentation repeats refusal and attempt semantics, so consolidate those sentences without removing contracts or raising budgets. The native Windows HTTP invalid-discovery control instead timed out on readiness; the identical39-test file passed on previous a2e739c837db5d245c2fbd9a57179cacab4f3990. Preserve this observation and require fresh native replay on the next head without increasing readiness or test limits."
  "2026-10-11T05:49:37.938Z","harness:codex","Consolidated repeated recovery prose while retaining anonymous main/tag selection, every-page total/identity validation, prior accepted/unknown refusal, exact-attempt exclusion, retained controls, same-tag concurrency, tracked changelog guard and all tracker links. Real Node24 build, original artifact gate and docs/skills check pass; the unchanged HTTP discovery regression file also passes locally. The Windows observation remains unqualified as to cause and must pass a fresh native head. No timeout, artifact ceiling, package feature, declaration or export was changed."
